# tensorfold-2node-glm53-flash-exl3 - read by up.sh, exported into the kit
# (the kit's scripts/config.sh honours the environment above its own defaults,
# and this workspace has NO .env inside the kit tree - one source of truth).
# Copy to .env and edit. Everything here is the KIT's name; the README table
# says what each one trades.

# 8902 here; the kit default 8888 is vllm-2node-tp2's port.
PORT=8902

# The headless-rank weight layout. nfs is this cluster's default (poseidon
# cannot hold the ~166 GiB `copy` wants); it REQUIRES the Ansible-side export:
#   make optional TAGS=nfs LIMIT=odysseus EXTRA='-e nfs_export_path=$HOME/.cache/huggingface'
# WORKER_WEIGHTS=copy
# NFS_PATH=${HOME}/.cache/huggingface
# NFS_SERVER=192.168.100.10

# up.sh fills WORKER/FABRIC_PEER from /etc/gx10/interconnect.peers; override
# only to point at the other rail or a different box.
# WORKER=epappas@poseidon
# FABRIC_PEER=192.168.100.11

# Serving shape (kit defaults; PARALLEL needs DRAFTER=dflash2):
# PARALLEL=4
# CONTEXT=1048576
# KV=fp8                    # bf16 is exact -> window 196,608
# DENSE=q4                  # fp8 keeps stop strings at q4's risk; bf16 exact
# THINKING=1
# MAX_TOKENS=32768

# THE LICENCE SWITCH. dflash2 is CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 (non-commercial only) and is
# what the kit's 60-115 tok/s numbers were taken with; mtp is the checkpoint's
# own head, unencumbered, and forces PARALLEL=1 (one request at a time).
# DRAFTER=mtp

# The engine's own dials that upstream leaves on, spelled out for reversions:
# COMM=roce                 # nccl: NCCL for all gathers (roce is +6%, same bits)
# TF_ROCE_WAIT_S=300        # a late peer costs a slow round, not a dead pair
# DRAFT_POLICY=fnc7:0.3     # product-of-chances stop on DFlash2 chains
# COPY=1 COPY_MAX=15        # prompt-lookup drafts beside DFlash2 (exact)
# TF_GLM_FILL_ROWS=2048
# TF_GLM_MULTI_WINDOW=32
# KV_POOL_GIB=12.5
# MEMORY_RESERVE_GIB=14.5

# PULL=0                    # never pull the published image (local build path)
# DRY_RUN=1                 # print both ranks' docker commands, change nothing
# ABLIT=1                   # gated Ablit weights (needs HF_TOKEN + repo access);
#                           # also drops THINKING's default to 0
